{
  "title": "Veterinary Center for Clinical Trials (VCCT)",
  "text": "Veterinary Center for Clinical Trials (VCCT)\nSkip to main content\nMenu\nVeterinary Center for Clinical Trials (VCCT)\nVeterinary Center for Clinical Trials (VCCT)\nOpen Search\nSearch\nVet Med Links\n+\nVet Med Home\nGiving\nContact / Directions\nNews\nAdmissions\nAlumni\nFaculty\nFuture Veterinary Medical Center\nDisaster Response\nVet Med Extension\nJobs\nCampus Directory\nCanvas\nVIPER\nVMACS\nMain navigation (extended config)\nAbout Us\nMission & Goals\nOur Team\nArticles & News\nPublications\nContact Us\nCurrent Clinical Trials\nVCCT Circle Fund\nOwners & Vets\nFrequently Asked Questions\nContact Us\nSponsors\nVCCT & Sponsor Partnerships\nRegulatory Compliance\nEquipment & Resources\nSponsor Inquiry\nInternal\nCIRCLE Program & Application\nVCCT Team\nVCCT Updates\nVCCT Menu & Budget Development\nRecruitment & Advertisement\nProtocol development, SOPs, & templates\nClinical Trial Review Board (CTRB)\nData Collection & Management\nClinical Support\nLabwork for Clinical Trials\nInvestigational Drugs\nPet Owners & Referring Vets\nWant to help advance veterinary medicine?  Curious about clinical trials?  Find out about the exciting studies happening at UC Davis!\nMore Info\nSponsors\nLooking to initiate a veterinary clinical trial?  Curious about fee-for-service options? Find out how we can help you with your research needs!\nVisit Now\nHelp Support Veterinary Clinical Trials!\nClick Here to Donate\nCurrent Clinical Trials\nUC Davis Veterinary Medicine conducts 30-50 research studies at any given time, including basic science, translational, and clinical trial research — all with the goal of bringing new, effective and safe treatments to our veterinary patients more quickly. Use\nStudy Pages\nto browse and connect with active recruiting studies at UC Davis Veterinary Medicine. Through\nStudy Pages\n, potential participants may find out more information about studies and contact study staff to see if their pet may be eligible.\nContact Us\nEmergency\nVet Med News & Events\nVet Med Extension\nVet Med Publications\nPrivacy Policy\nEmail for Accessibility Issues\nMake a Gift to the UC Davis Weill School of Veterinary Medicine\nWeill School of Veterinary Medicine Social Media Hub\nVIPER\nFaculty\nAlumni\nFuture Veterinary Medical Center\nCampus Directory\n#1 Vet School in the USA\nPrivacy & Accessibility\nPrinciples of Community\nUniversity of California\nCopyright © The Regents of the University of California, Davis campus. All rights reserved.\nThis site is officially grown in\nSiteFarm\n.",
